window.ATLAS_SEARCH_INDEX = {"generatedFrom":"Atlas v1.8 exported HTML (PARTS / PARTS_EN data, unmodified)","stdNames":{"fci":{"ja":"FCI","en":"FCI"},"akc":{"ja":"AKC","en":"AKC"},"kc":{"ja":"KC（英国）","en":"KC (UK)"}},"entries":[{"std":"fci","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":0,"labelJa":"全体像","labelEn":"General appearance","ja":"ライオン様の外観で、警戒心のある聡明な表情。小型で、バランスが良く、適度にずっしりしており、大きな威厳と質を備える。いかなる理由でも呼吸困難の兆候があること、または健全に動けないことは容認できない。過剰なコートではないこと","en":"Lion-like appearance with an alert, intelligent expression. Small, well balanced, moderately thick-set, with great dignity and quality. Any sign of breathing difficulty for any reason, or inability to move soundly, is unacceptable. Not excessively coated","orig":"","slug":"overall--general-appearance","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/overall--general-appearance"},{"std":"fci","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":1,"labelJa":"気質","labelEn":"Temperament","ja":"恐れを知らず、忠実で、よそよそしい（aloof）。臆病でも攻撃的でもない","en":"Fearless, loyal, aloof. Not timid or aggressive","orig":"","slug":"overall--temperament","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/overall--temperament"},{"std":"fci","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":2,"labelJa":"サイズ・体重","labelEn":"Size and weight","ja":"理想体重は牡 5kg以下、牝 5.4kg以下。見た目は小さいのに、持ち上げると驚くほど重いはず。重い骨と、頑丈でよくできた体がこの犬種の本質","en":"Ideal weight not exceeding 5 kg for males and 5.4 kg for females. The dog should look small but be surprisingly heavy when picked up. Heavy bone and a sturdy, well-built body are essentials of the breed","orig":"","slug":"overall--size-and-weight","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/overall--size-and-weight"},{"std":"fci","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":3,"labelJa":"分類（参考）","labelEn":"Classification (reference)","ja":"原産：中国。パトロネージ：英国。用途：愛玩犬。FCIグループ9（愛玩犬）セクション8（狆とペキニーズ）、作業試験なし","en":"Origin: China. Patronage: Great Britain. Utility: companion dog. FCI Group 9 (Companion and Toy Dogs), Section 8 (Japan Chin and Pekingese), without working trial","orig":"","slug":"overall--classification-reference","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/overall--classification-reference"},{"std":"akc","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":0,"labelJa":"全体像","labelEn":"General appearance","ja":"バランスの取れたコンパクトな犬で、前が重く後ろ（後方）が軽い。中国原産であることを示す、率直さ・独立心・個性を気質とする。イメージはライオン様で、勇気・威厳・大胆さ・自尊心を意味し、か弱さ（prettiness）や繊細さではない","en":"A well-balanced, compact dog with a heavy front and a lighter rear (hindquarters). Its temperament shows its Chinese origin: frankness, independence and individuality. The image is lion-like, implying courage, dignity, boldness and self-esteem — not prettiness or delicacy","orig":"","slug":"overall--general-appearance","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/overall--general-appearance"},{"std":"akc","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":1,"labelJa":"割合","labelEn":"Proportion","ja":"全体のバランスが最も重要。頭は体に対して大きい。体高よりやや長く、体長は前胸（forechest、胸骨端）から臀部まで測る。全体の輪郭は近似比率 3：5（高さ3：長さ5）。この物差しは胸から測るAKC式専用で、肩端から測るFCI式の比とは直接比べられません（この末尾の一文は本アプリの解説です）。","en":"Overall balance is of utmost importance. The head is large in proportion to the body. The body is slightly longer than tall, length being measured from the forechest (prosternum) to the buttocks. The overall outline is an approximate ratio of 3 high to 5 long. This measure belongs to the AKC system (from the chest) only and cannot be compared directly with a ratio measured from the shoulder point in the FCI system (this last sentence is this app’s commentary).","orig":"slightly longer than tall when measured from the forechest to the buttocks. The overall outline is an approximate ratio of 3 high to 5 long.","slug":"overall--proportion","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/overall--proportion"},{"std":"akc","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":2,"labelJa":"サイズ・実質","labelEn":"Size and substance","ja":"持ち上げると大きさの割に驚くほど重い。がっしりした筋肉質の体。14ポンドの上限以内なら全ての体重が正しい","en":"Surprisingly heavy for its size when picked up. A sturdy, muscular body. All weights are correct within the 14 lb limit","orig":"","slug":"overall--size-and-substance","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/overall--size-and-substance"},{"std":"akc","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":3,"labelJa":"失格（要点）","labelEn":"Disqualification (key point)","ja":"体重が14ポンド（約6.35kg）を超えると失格","en":"Weight over 14 lb (approx. 6.35 kg) is a disqualification","orig":"","slug":"overall--disqualification-key-point","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/overall--disqualification-key-point"},{"std":"kc","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":0,"labelJa":"全体","labelEn":"General characteristics","ja":"小型で、バランスが良く、適度にずっしりし、大きな威厳と質を備える。いかなる理由でも呼吸困難の兆候があること、または健全に動けないことは容認できない。過剰なコートではないこと","en":"Small, well balanced, moderately thick-set, with great dignity and quality. Any sign of breathing difficulty for any reason, or inability to move soundly, is unacceptable. Not excessively coated","orig":"","slug":"overall--general-characteristics","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/overall--general-characteristics"},{"std":"kc","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":1,"labelJa":"特徴","labelEn":"Characteristics","ja":"ライオン様の外観。警戒心のある聡明な表情","en":"Lion-like appearance. Alert, intelligent expression","orig":"","slug":"overall--characteristics","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/overall--characteristics"},{"std":"kc","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":2,"labelJa":"気質","labelEn":"Temperament","ja":"恐れを知らず、忠実で、よそよそしい。臆病でも攻撃的でもない","en":"Fearless, loyal, aloof. Not timid or aggressive","orig":"","slug":"overall--temperament","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/overall--temperament"},{"std":"kc","part":"overall","partJa":"全体・バランス","partEn":"Overall balance","idx":3,"labelJa":"サイズ","labelEn":"Size","ja":"理想体重は牡 5kg（11ポンド）以下、牝 5.4kg（12ポンド）以下。見た目は小さいのに持ち上げると驚くほど重く、重い骨と頑丈な体が本質","en":"Ideal weight not exceeding 5 kg (11 lb) for males and 5.4 kg (12 lb) for females. The dog looks small but is surprisingly heavy when picked up; heavy bone and a sturdy body are essentials","orig":"","slug":"overall--size","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/overall--size"},{"std":"fci","part":"skull","partJa":"頭・スカル","partEn":"Head & skull","idx":0,"labelJa":"頭","labelEn":"Head","ja":"かなり大きく、比例として深さよりも幅が広い","en":"Fairly large, proportionately wider than deep","orig":"","slug":"skull--head","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/skull--head"},{"std":"fci","part":"skull","partJa":"頭・スカル","partEn":"Head & skull","idx":1,"labelJa":"スカル","labelEn":"Skull","ja":"適度に広く、耳の間で広く平坦。ドーム状ではない。目の間が広い","en":"Moderately wide, wide and flat between the ears. Not dome-shaped. Wide between the eyes","orig":"","slug":"skull--skull","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/skull--skull"},{"std":"fci","part":"skull","partJa":"頭・スカル","partEn":"Head & skull","idx":2,"labelJa":"ストップ","labelEn":"Stop","ja":"明確である（Defined）","en":"Defined","orig":"","slug":"skull--stop","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/skull--stop"},{"std":"akc","part":"skull","partJa":"頭・スカル","partEn":"Head & skull","idx":0,"labelJa":"顔・トップスカル","labelEn":"Face and top skull","ja":"トップスカルは大きく（massive）、広く、平坦（ドーム状ではない）。広く離れた目、頬骨、広い下顎と合わさって、正しい顔のかたちを作る","en":"The top skull is massive, broad and flat (not dome-shaped). Together with the wide-set eyes, the cheekbones and the broad lower jaw, it makes the correct shape of face","orig":"","slug":"skull--face-and-top-skull","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/skull--face-and-top-skull"},{"std":"akc","part":"skull","partJa":"頭・スカル","partEn":"Head & skull","idx":1,"labelJa":"正面のかたち","labelEn":"Shape from the front","ja":"正面から見るとスカルは深さより幅が広く、望ましい長方形の「封筒型（envelope-shaped）」の外観に寄与する","en":"Seen from the front, the skull is wider than deep and contributes to the desired rectangular, envelope-shaped appearance","orig":"","slug":"skull--shape-from-the-front","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/skull--shape-from-the-front"},{"std":"akc","part":"skull","partJa":"頭・スカル","partEn":"Head & skull","idx":2,"labelJa":"横顔","labelEn":"Profile","ja":"横から見ると顔は平坦で、あご・鼻革・眉がすべて一直線の面にあり、その面はあごから額へわずかに後方へ傾く","en":"In profile the face is flat: chin, nose leather and brow all lie in one plane, which slants very slightly backward from chin to forehead","orig":"","slug":"skull--profile","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/skull--profile"},{"std":"kc","part":"skull","partJa":"頭・スカル","partEn":"Head & skull","idx":0,"labelJa":"頭とスカル","labelEn":"Head and skull","ja":"頭はかなり大きく、比例として深さよりも幅が広い。スカルは適度に広く、耳の間で広く平坦で、ドーム状ではなく、目の間が広い","en":"The head is fairly large, proportionately wider than deep. The skull is moderately wide, wide and flat between the ears, not dome-shaped, and wide between the eyes","orig":"","slug":"skull--head-and-skull","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/skull--head-and-skull"},{"std":"kc","part":"skull","partJa":"頭・スカル","partEn":"Head & skull","idx":1,"labelJa":"ストップ","labelEn":"Stop","ja":"明確である","en":"Defined","orig":"","slug":"skull--stop","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/skull--stop"},{"std":"fci","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":0,"labelJa":"色素","labelEn":"Pigment","ja":"鼻・唇・目の縁の黒い色素が必須","en":"Black pigment is essential on the nose, lips and eye rims","orig":"","slug":"face--pigment","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/face--pigment"},{"std":"fci","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":1,"labelJa":"鼻","labelEn":"Nose","ja":"短すぎず、広い。鼻孔は大きく開いている","en":"Not too short, broad. Nostrils large and open","orig":"","slug":"face--nose","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/face--nose"},{"std":"fci","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":2,"labelJa":"リンクル","labelEn":"Wrinkle","ja":"軽いリンクルが、できれば途切れながら、頬から鼻梁へ広い逆V字に延びてよい。ただし目や鼻に悪影響を与えたり、覆ったりしては決してならない。狭い鼻孔（pinched nostrils）と重い鼻上のリンクルは容認できない","en":"A slight wrinkle, preferably broken, may extend from the cheeks to the bridge of the nose in a broad inverted V. It must never adversely affect or obscure the eyes or nose. Pinched nostrils and a heavy over-nose wrinkle are unacceptable","orig":"","slug":"face--wrinkle","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/face--wrinkle"},{"std":"fci","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":3,"labelJa":"マズル","labelEn":"Muzzle","ja":"明瞭でなければならないが、比較的短く広くてよい。しっかりした下顎","en":"Must be evident, but may be relatively short and wide. Firm lower jaw","orig":"","slug":"face--muzzle","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/face--muzzle"},{"std":"fci","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":4,"labelJa":"唇","labelEn":"Lips","ja":"水平な唇。歯や舌を見せてはならず、明瞭なあごを覆い隠してもならない","en":"Level lips. Must not show teeth or tongue, nor obscure a well-defined chin","orig":"","slug":"face--lips","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/face--lips"},{"std":"akc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":0,"labelJa":"鼻","labelEn":"Nose","ja":"広く、短く、黒い。鼻孔は狭いのではなく、広く開いている。鼻の上端を通る水平線は、目の中心のやや上と交わる","en":"Broad, short and black. The nostrils are wide open, not pinched. A horizontal line drawn across the top of the nose intersects slightly above the centre of the eyes","orig":"","slug":"face--nose","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/face--nose"},{"std":"akc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":1,"labelJa":"リンクル","labelEn":"Wrinkle","ja":"顔の上下を分ける。毛に覆われた皮膚のひだで、一方の頬から鼻梁を越えて広い逆V字でもう一方の頬へ延びる。顔の特徴を圧迫するほど顕著・重くてはならず、目を少し以上覆ったり、鼻革の上に前方へ垂れたりしない","en":"Divides the upper and lower parts of the face. A fold of skin, covered with hair, extends from one cheek over the bridge of the nose in a broad inverted V to the other cheek. It must never be so prominent or heavy as to crowd the facial features, obscure more than a little of the eyes, or hang over the nose leather","orig":"","slug":"face--wrinkle","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/face--wrinkle"},{"std":"akc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":2,"labelJa":"ストップ","labelEn":"Stop","ja":"鼻上のリンクルによって視界から隠れている","en":"Hidden from view by the over-nose wrinkle","orig":"","slug":"face--stop","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/face--stop"},{"std":"akc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":3,"labelJa":"マズル","labelEn":"Muzzle","ja":"非常に平坦で広く、目の下がよく詰まっている（well filled-in）。皮膚は全ての毛色で黒い。ひげ（whiskers）が望ましい表情に加わる","en":"Very flat and broad, well filled-in below the eyes. The skin is black on all coat colours. Whiskers add to the desired expression","orig":"","slug":"face--muzzle","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/face--muzzle"},{"std":"akc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":4,"labelJa":"口","labelEn":"Mouth","ja":"下顎はアンダーショットで広い。黒い唇はきちんと合い、口を閉じたときに歯も舌も見えない","en":"The lower jaw is undershot and broad. The black lips meet neatly; neither teeth nor tongue show when the mouth is closed","orig":"","slug":"face--mouth","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/face--mouth"},{"std":"kc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":0,"labelJa":"鼻","labelEn":"Nose","ja":"短すぎず、広く、鼻孔は大きく開いている","en":"Not too short, broad, with large open nostrils","orig":"","slug":"face--nose","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/face--nose"},{"std":"kc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":1,"labelJa":"リンクル","labelEn":"Wrinkle","ja":"軽いリンクルが、できれば途切れながら、頬から鼻梁へ広い逆V字に延びてよい。目や鼻に悪影響を与えたり覆ったりしては決してならず、狭い鼻孔と重い鼻上のリンクルは容認できない","en":"A slight wrinkle, preferably broken, may extend from the cheeks to the bridge of the nose in a broad inverted V. It must never adversely affect or obscure the eyes or nose; pinched nostrils and a heavy over-nose wrinkle are unacceptable","orig":"","slug":"face--wrinkle","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/face--wrinkle"},{"std":"kc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":2,"labelJa":"マズル・顎","labelEn":"Muzzle and jaw","ja":"マズルは明瞭でなければならないが、比較的短く広くてよい。しっかりした下顎","en":"The muzzle must be evident, but may be relatively short and wide. Firm lower jaw","orig":"","slug":"face--muzzle-and-jaw","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/face--muzzle-and-jaw"},{"std":"kc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":3,"labelJa":"唇・色素","labelEn":"Lips and pigment","ja":"唇は明瞭なあごを覆わない。黒い色素が鼻・唇・目の縁に必須","en":"The lips must not obscure a well-defined chin. Black pigment is essential on the nose, lips and eye rims","orig":"","slug":"face--lips-and-pigment","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/face--lips-and-pigment"},{"std":"kc","part":"face","partJa":"顔 ― 鼻・マズル・口","partEn":"Face — nose, muzzle, mouth","idx":4,"labelJa":"口","labelEn":"Mouth","ja":"水平な唇で、歯や舌を見せない。しっかりした下顎が必須","en":"Level lips, not showing teeth or tongue. A firm lower jaw is essential","orig":"","slug":"face--mouth","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/face--mouth"},{"std":"fci","part":"eyesears","partJa":"目・耳","partEn":"Eyes & ears","idx":0,"labelJa":"目","labelEn":"Eyes","ja":"明瞭で、丸く、暗く輝き、大きすぎない。明らかな目の問題がないこと","en":"Clear, round, dark and lustrous, not too large. Free from obvious eye problems","orig":"","slug":"eyesears--eyes","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/eyesears--eyes"},{"std":"fci","part":"eyesears","partJa":"目・耳","partEn":"Eyes & ears","idx":1,"labelJa":"耳","labelEn":"Ears","ja":"耳革はハート型。スカルの高さに付き、頭に密着して保たれ、マズルのラインより下に来ない。長く豊かな飾り毛","en":"Leathers heart-shaped. Set at the level of the skull, carried close to the head, and not coming below the line of the muzzle. Long, profuse feathering","orig":"","slug":"eyesears--ears","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/eyesears--ears"},{"std":"akc","part":"eyesears","partJa":"目・耳","partEn":"Eyes & ears","idx":0,"labelJa":"目","labelEn":"Eyes","ja":"大きく、非常に暗く、丸く、輝き、広く離れて付く。視線は大胆で、突出（bulging）ではない。目の縁は黒く、犬が真っ直ぐ前を見ているとき白目が見えない","en":"Large, very dark, round, lustrous and set wide apart. The look is bold, not bulging. The eye rims are black, and no white of the eye shows when the dog looks straight ahead","orig":"","slug":"eyesears--eyes","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/eyesears--eyes"},{"std":"akc","part":"eyesears","partJa":"目・耳","partEn":"Eyes & ears","idx":1,"labelJa":"耳","labelEn":"Ears","ja":"ハート型。トップスカルの前方の角に付き、頭に平らに沿う。耳革は顎より下に延びない。正しく付いた耳は、重い飾り毛と長いフリンジで顔の両側を縁取り、広い長方形の頭の外観を強める","en":"Heart-shaped. Set on the front corners of the top skull and lying flat against the head. The leather does not extend below the jaw. Correctly set ears, with their heavy feathering and long fringe, frame both sides of the face and strengthen the broad, rectangular appearance of the head","orig":"","slug":"eyesears--ears","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/eyesears--ears"},{"std":"kc","part":"eyesears","partJa":"目・耳","partEn":"Eyes & ears","idx":0,"labelJa":"目","labelEn":"Eyes","ja":"明瞭で、丸く、暗く輝き、大きすぎない。明らかな目の問題がないこと","en":"Clear, round, dark and lustrous, not too large. Free from obvious eye problems","orig":"","slug":"eyesears--eyes","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/eyesears--eyes"},{"std":"kc","part":"eyesears","partJa":"目・耳","partEn":"Eyes & ears","idx":1,"labelJa":"耳","labelEn":"Ears","ja":"耳革はハート型。スカルの高さに付き、頭に密着して保たれ、マズルのラインより下に来ない。長く豊かな飾り毛","en":"Leathers heart-shaped. Set at the level of the skull, carried close to the head, and not coming below the line of the muzzle. Long, profuse feathering","orig":"","slug":"eyesears--ears","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/eyesears--ears"},{"std":"fci","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":0,"labelJa":"首","labelEn":"Neck","ja":"比較的短く、太い","en":"Relatively short and thick","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--neck","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/neckbody--neck"},{"std":"fci","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":1,"labelJa":"体","labelEn":"Body","ja":"比較的短く、はっきりしたウエストがある","en":"Relatively short, with a distinct waist","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--body","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/neckbody--body"},{"std":"fci","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":2,"labelJa":"トップライン","labelEn":"Topline","ja":"水平","en":"Level","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--topline","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/neckbody--topline"},{"std":"fci","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":3,"labelJa":"胸","labelEn":"Chest","ja":"広く、よく張った肋が前肢の間に吊り下がっている（slung between forelegs）","en":"Broad, with well-sprung ribs slung between the forelegs","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--chest","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/neckbody--chest"},{"std":"akc","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":0,"labelJa":"首","labelEn":"Neck","ja":"非常に短く、太い","en":"Very short and thick","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--neck","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/neckbody--neck"},{"std":"akc","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":1,"labelJa":"体","labelEn":"Body","ja":"洋梨型（pear-shaped）で、コンパクトで、地に低い。前が重く、よく張った肋が前肢の間に吊り下がる。前胸は広く充実し、突出した胸骨はない","en":"Pear-shaped, compact and low to the ground. Heavy in front, with well-sprung ribs slung between the forelegs. The forechest is broad and full; there is no protruding breastbone","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--body","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/neckbody--body"},{"std":"akc","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":2,"labelJa":"アンダーライン・腰","labelEn":"Underline and loins","ja":"アンダーラインは深い胸から軽い腰へ上がり、細いウエストを作る。腰は短い","en":"The underline rises from the deep chest to the lighter loins, making a narrow waist. The loins are short","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--underline-and-loins","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/neckbody--underline-and-loins"},{"std":"akc","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":3,"labelJa":"トップライン","labelEn":"Topline","ja":"真っ直ぐ（straight）","en":"Straight","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--topline","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/neckbody--topline"},{"std":"kc","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":0,"labelJa":"首","labelEn":"Neck","ja":"比較的短く、太い","en":"Relatively short and thick","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--neck","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/neckbody--neck"},{"std":"kc","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":1,"labelJa":"体","labelEn":"Body","ja":"比較的短い。はっきりしたウエスト。広い胸と、よく張った肋が前肢の間に吊り下がる","en":"Relatively short. Distinct waist. Broad chest, with well-sprung ribs slung between the forelegs","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--body","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/neckbody--body"},{"std":"kc","part":"neckbody","partJa":"首・体・胸","partEn":"Neck, body & chest","idx":2,"labelJa":"トップライン","labelEn":"Topline","ja":"水平","en":"Level","orig":"","slug":"neckbody--topline","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/neckbody--topline"},{"std":"fci","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":0,"labelJa":"前肢総論","labelEn":"Forequarters in general","ja":"比較的短く、太く、骨太な前肢。足の上にしっかり立ち、パスターン（繋）に沈んでいないこと。絶対的な健全性が必須","en":"Relatively short, thick, heavily boned forelegs. The dog stands well up on its feet and does not sink at the pasterns. Absolute soundness is essential","orig":"","slug":"fore--forequarters-in-general","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/fore--forequarters-in-general"},{"std":"fci","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":1,"labelJa":"肩","labelEn":"Shoulders","ja":"後方へ傾斜し（laid back）、体へ滑らかに付いている","en":"Laid back and fitting smoothly into the body","orig":"","slug":"fore--shoulders","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/fore--shoulders"},{"std":"fci","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":2,"labelJa":"肘","labelEn":"Elbows","ja":"体に近い","en":"Close to the body","orig":"","slug":"fore--elbows","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/fore--elbows"},{"std":"fci","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":3,"labelJa":"前腕","labelEn":"Forearms","ja":"前肢の骨は、パスターンと肘の間でわずかに湾曲してよく、肋を収める（accommodating ribs）","en":"The bones of the forelegs may bow slightly between pasterns and elbows, accommodating the ribs","orig":"","slug":"fore--forearms","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/fore--forearms"},{"std":"fci","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":4,"labelJa":"繋（パスターン）","labelEn":"Pasterns","ja":"わずかに傾斜し、強く、互いに近すぎない","en":"Slightly sloping, strong, and not too close together","orig":"","slug":"fore--pasterns","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/fore--pasterns"},{"std":"fci","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":5,"labelJa":"前足","labelEn":"Front feet","ja":"大きく平坦で、丸くない。わずかに外向きでよい。過度に外向きの足は非常に望ましくない","en":"Large and flat, not round. May turn out slightly. Excessively turned-out feet are highly undesirable","orig":"","slug":"fore--front-feet","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/fore--front-feet"},{"std":"akc","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":0,"labelJa":"前肢総論","labelEn":"Forequarters in general","ja":"短く、太く、骨太。前肢の骨はパスターンと肘の間で適度に湾曲している。広い胸、広く離れた前肢、より近くにある後肢が、正しいローリング歩様に寄与する","en":"Short, thick and heavily boned. The bones of the forelegs bow moderately between pasterns and elbows. The broad chest, the wide-set forelegs and the closer hindlegs all contribute to the correct rolling gait","orig":"","slug":"fore--forequarters-in-general","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/fore--forequarters-in-general"},{"std":"akc","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":1,"labelJa":"肩の釣り合い","labelEn":"Shoulder balance","ja":"肩の点からキ甲の先端までの距離は、肩の点から肘までの距離とほぼ等しい","en":"The distance from the point of shoulder to the tip of the withers is approximately equal to the distance from the point of shoulder to the elbow","orig":"","slug":"fore--shoulder-balance","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/fore--shoulder-balance"},{"std":"akc","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":2,"labelJa":"肩・肘","labelEn":"Shoulders and elbows","ja":"肩はよく後方へ傾斜し、体へ滑らかに付く。肘は常に体に近い","en":"The shoulders are well laid back and fit smoothly into the body. The elbows are always close to the body","orig":"","slug":"fore--shoulders-and-elbows","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/fore--shoulders-and-elbows"},{"std":"akc","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":3,"labelJa":"足・繋","labelEn":"Feet and pasterns","ja":"前足は、立ったときも動くときも、わずかに外向き。パスターンは緩やかに傾斜する","en":"The front feet turn out slightly, standing or moving. The pasterns slope gently","orig":"","slug":"fore--feet-and-pasterns","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/fore--feet-and-pasterns"},{"std":"kc","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":0,"labelJa":"前肢総論","labelEn":"Forequarters in general","ja":"比較的短く、太く、骨太な前肢。前肢の骨はパスターンと肘の間でわずかに湾曲してよく、肋を収める。肘は体に近くなるべきで、肩は後方へ傾斜し体へ滑らかに付く。足の上にしっかり立ち、パスターンに沈まない。パスターンは強く、互いに近すぎない。絶対的な健全性が必須","en":"Relatively short, thick, heavily boned forelegs. The bones of the forelegs may bow slightly between pasterns and elbows, accommodating the ribs. Elbows should be close to the body; shoulders laid back and fitting smoothly into the body. The dog stands well up on its feet and does not sink at the pasterns. Pasterns strong and not too close together. Absolute soundness is essential","orig":"","slug":"fore--forequarters-in-general","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/fore--forequarters-in-general"},{"std":"kc","part":"fore","partJa":"前肢","partEn":"Forequarters","idx":1,"labelJa":"前足","labelEn":"Front feet","ja":"大きく平坦で、丸くない。前足はわずかに外向きでよい。過度に外向きの足は非常に望ましくない","en":"Large and flat, not round. The front feet may turn out slightly. Excessively turned-out feet are highly undesirable","orig":"","slug":"fore--front-feet","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/fore--front-feet"},{"std":"fci","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":0,"labelJa":"後肢総論","labelEn":"Hindquarters in general","ja":"後肢は強く、よく筋肉が付いているが、前肢より適度に軽い。過度に狭い後方は非常に望ましくない。適度な角度。絶対的な健全性が必須","en":"The hindlegs are strong and well muscled, but moderately lighter than the forelegs. An excessively narrow rear is highly undesirable. Moderate angulation. Absolute soundness is essential","orig":"","slug":"hind--hindquarters-in-general","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/hind--hindquarters-in-general"},{"std":"fci","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":1,"labelJa":"膝（スティフル）","labelEn":"Stifles","ja":"明瞭である（well defined）","en":"Well defined","orig":"","slug":"hind--stifles","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/hind--stifles"},{"std":"fci","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":2,"labelJa":"飛節","labelEn":"Hocks","ja":"しっかりして、低く","en":"Firm and low","orig":"","slug":"hind--hocks","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/hind--hocks"},{"std":"fci","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":3,"labelJa":"後繋","labelEn":"Rear pasterns","ja":"強く、後ろから見て平行","en":"Strong, parallel when viewed from behind","orig":"","slug":"hind--rear-pasterns","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/hind--rear-pasterns"},{"std":"fci","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":4,"labelJa":"後足","labelEn":"Hind feet","ja":"大きく平坦で、丸くない。真っ直ぐ前方を向く","en":"Large and flat, not round. Pointing straight forward","orig":"","slug":"hind--hind-feet","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/hind--hind-feet"},{"std":"fci","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":5,"labelJa":"尾","labelEn":"Tail","ja":"高く付き、しっかりと保たれ、背の上へどちらかの側へわずかに湾曲する。長い飾り毛","en":"Set high, carried firmly, curved slightly over the back to either side. Long feathering","orig":"","slug":"hind--tail","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/hind--tail"},{"std":"akc","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":0,"labelJa":"後肢","labelEn":"Hindquarters","ja":"前肢より骨が軽い。スティフル（膝）と飛節に適度な角度がある。後ろから見ると、後肢は適度に近く平行で、立ったときも動くときも足は真っ直ぐ前方を向く","en":"Lighter in bone than the forequarters. Moderate angulation at stifle and hock. Seen from behind, the hindlegs are moderately close and parallel, and the feet point straight forward, standing or moving","orig":"","slug":"hind--hindquarters","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/hind--hindquarters"},{"std":"akc","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":1,"labelJa":"尾","labelEn":"Tail","ja":"高く付いた尾はわずかにアーチし、背の上によく運ばれる。よじれ（kinks）やカールがない。長く豊かで真っ直ぐなフリンジが、どちらかの側へ垂れてよい","en":"The high-set tail arches slightly and is well carried over the back. No kinks or curl. The long, profuse, straight fringe may fall to either side","orig":"","slug":"hind--tail","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/hind--tail"},{"std":"kc","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":0,"labelJa":"後肢","labelEn":"Hindquarters","ja":"後肢は強く、よく筋肉が付いているが、前肢より適度に軽い。過度に狭い後方は非常に望ましくない。適度な角度。明瞭なスティフル（膝）。しっかりした低い飛節。強い後繋で、後ろから見て平行。絶対的な健全性が必須","en":"The hindlegs are strong and well muscled, but moderately lighter than the forelegs. An excessively narrow rear is highly undesirable. Moderate angulation. Well-defined stifles. Firm, low hocks. Strong rear pasterns, parallel seen from behind. Absolute soundness is essential","orig":"","slug":"hind--hindquarters","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/hind--hindquarters"},{"std":"kc","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":1,"labelJa":"後足","labelEn":"Hind feet","ja":"大きく平坦で、丸くない。後足は真っ直ぐ前方を向く","en":"Large and flat, not round. The hind feet point straight forward","orig":"","slug":"hind--hind-feet","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/hind--hind-feet"},{"std":"kc","part":"hind","partJa":"後肢・尾","partEn":"Hindquarters & tail","idx":2,"labelJa":"尾","labelEn":"Tail","ja":"高く付き、しっかりと保たれ、背の上へどちらかの側へわずかに湾曲する。長い飾り毛","en":"Set high, carried firmly, curved slightly over the back to either side. Long feathering","orig":"","slug":"hind--tail","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/hind--tail"},{"std":"fci","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":0,"labelJa":"歩様","labelEn":"Gait","ja":"典型的にゆっくりで、威厳のある、前（フロント）でのローリング歩様。典型的な動きを、肩の緩みによるロールや、他の不健全の兆候と混同してはならない。肩と肘のいかなる緩みも、足とパスターンの不健全のいかなる兆候も、重く罰せられる。過剰な体のコートによって動きを妨げてはならない","en":"Typically slow, dignified, with a rolling gait in front. The typical movement must not be confused with a roll caused by loose shoulders or any other sign of unsoundness. Any looseness of shoulders or elbows, and any sign of unsoundness in feet and pasterns, is heavily penalised. Movement must not be hindered by an excessive body coat","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--gait","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/gaitcoat--gait"},{"std":"fci","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":1,"labelJa":"被毛","labelEn":"Coat","ja":"適度に長く、真っ直ぐで、たてがみがあり、肩を越えては延びず、首の周りにケープを形作る。上毛は粗く、厚く柔らかい下毛がある。耳・肢の後ろ・尾・趾（あしゆび）に飾り毛。被毛の長さと量は、犬の活動を損なわず、体の形（shapeliness）を覆い隠さないこと。過剰なコートは重く罰せられなければならない","en":"Moderately long and straight, with a mane that does not extend beyond the shoulders and forms a cape around the neck. Coarse topcoat with a thick, softer undercoat. Feathering on ears, backs of legs, tail and toes. The length and amount of coat must neither impair the dog’s activity nor obscure the shapeliness of the body. An excessive coat must be heavily penalised","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--coat","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/gaitcoat--coat"},{"std":"fci","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":2,"labelJa":"欠点","labelEn":"Faults","ja":"上記の点からの逸脱はすべて欠点であり、その重大さは、逸脱の程度と、犬の健康と福祉への影響に正確に比例して判断される","en":"Any departure from the foregoing points is a fault, and its seriousness is judged in exact proportion to its degree and its effect on the dog’s health and welfare","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--faults","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/gaitcoat--faults"},{"std":"fci","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":3,"labelJa":"失格欠点","labelEn":"Disqualifying faults","ja":"攻撃的または過度に臆病な犬。身体的または行動的な異常を明確に示す犬","en":"Aggressive or overly shy dogs. Dogs clearly showing physical or behavioural abnormalities","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--disqualifying-faults","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/gaitcoat--disqualifying-faults"},{"std":"fci","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":4,"labelJa":"注記","labelEn":"N.B.","ja":"牡は、見た目に正常な睾丸が2つ、陰嚢へ完全に下降していること。繁殖には、機能的・臨床的に健康で、犬種の典型的な体格を持つ犬だけを用いること","en":"Males should have two apparently normal testicles fully descended into the scrotum. Only functionally and clinically healthy dogs with breed-typical conformation should be used for breeding","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--n-b","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/gaitcoat--n-b"},{"std":"akc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":0,"labelJa":"歩様","labelEn":"Gait","ja":"急がず、威厳があり、自由で力強く、肩の上にわずかなロールがある。動きは滑らかで楽であり、跳ねる・跳躍する・衝撃を受けることから可能な限り自由。ローリング歩様は、湾曲した前肢、よく後方へ傾斜した肩、充実した広い胸、細く軽い後方の組み合わせから生まれ、十分なリーチと適度なドライブを生む","en":"Unhurried, dignified, free and strong, with a slight roll over the shoulders. The movement is smooth and effortless, as free as possible from bouncing, prancing or jarring. The rolling gait results from a combination of the bowed forelegs, well laid back shoulders, full broad chest and narrow light rear, and produces adequate reach and moderate drive","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--gait","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/gaitcoat--gait"},{"std":"akc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":1,"labelJa":"コート","labelEn":"Coat","ja":"長く、粗い質感で、真っ直ぐに立ち上がる上毛と、厚く柔らかい下毛。首と肩の部分に顕著なたてがみを作り、体の残りの部分のコートはやや短め。長く豊かなコートは、体の形を覆い隠さない限り望ましい。趾・大腿の後ろ・前肢の後ろに長い飾り毛があり、耳と尾にはより長いフリンジがある","en":"A long topcoat of coarse texture, standing well away from the body, over a thick, soft undercoat. It forms a noticeable mane on the neck and shoulder area, while the coat on the rest of the body is somewhat shorter. A long, profuse coat is desirable as long as it does not obscure the shape of the body. Long feathering on the toes, the backs of the thighs and forelegs, and longer fringes on ears and tail","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--coat","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/gaitcoat--coat"},{"std":"akc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":2,"labelJa":"プレゼンテーション","labelEn":"Presentation","ja":"自然な輪郭を強調すること。自然な外観を損なう明らかなトリミングや彫刻（スカルプティング）は、重く罰せられるべきである","en":"To accentuate the natural outline. Obvious trimming or sculpting that detracts from the natural appearance should be heavily penalised","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--presentation","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/gaitcoat--presentation"},{"std":"akc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":3,"labelJa":"失格","labelEn":"Disqualification","ja":"体重が14ポンドを超えること","en":"Weight over 14 lb","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--disqualification","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/gaitcoat--disqualification"},{"std":"akc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":4,"labelJa":"原則","labelEn":"Principle","ja":"以上は理想のペキニーズの記述である。いかなる逸脱も、その程度に正確に比例して罰せられるべきである","en":"The foregoing is a description of the ideal Pekingese. Any deviation is to be penalised in exact proportion to its degree","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--principle","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/gaitcoat--principle"},{"std":"kc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":0,"labelJa":"歩様","labelEn":"Gait","ja":"典型的にゆっくりで、威厳のある、前でのローリング歩様。典型的な動きを、肩の緩みによるロールや他の不健全の兆候と混同してはならない。肩と肘のいかなる緩みも、足とパスターンの不健全のいかなる兆候も、容認できない。過剰な体のコートによって動きが妨げられることも容認できない","en":"Typically slow, dignified, with a rolling gait in front. The typical movement must not be confused with a roll caused by loose shoulders or any other sign of unsoundness. Any looseness of shoulders or elbows, and any sign of unsoundness in feet and pasterns, is unacceptable. Movement hindered by an excessive body coat is also unacceptable","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--gait","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/gaitcoat--gait"},{"std":"kc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":1,"labelJa":"コート","labelEn":"Coat","ja":"適度に長く、真っ直ぐで、たてがみがあり、肩を越えては延びず、首の周りにケープを形作る。上毛は粗く、厚く柔らかい下毛がある。耳・肢の後ろ・尾・趾に飾り毛。被毛の長さと量は、犬の活動を損なわず、体の形を覆い隠さないこと。過剰なコートは非常に望ましくない","en":"Moderately long and straight, with a mane that does not extend beyond the shoulders and forms a cape around the neck. Coarse topcoat with a thick, softer undercoat. Feathering on ears, backs of legs, tail and toes. The length and amount of coat must neither impair the dog’s activity nor obscure the shape of the body. An excessive coat is highly undesirable","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--coat","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/gaitcoat--coat"},{"std":"kc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":2,"labelJa":"欠点","labelEn":"Faults","ja":"上記の点からの逸脱はすべて欠点であり、その重大さは、逸脱の程度と、犬の健康と福祉への影響に正確に比例して判断される","en":"Any departure from the foregoing points is a fault, and its seriousness is judged in exact proportion to its degree and its effect on the dog’s health and welfare","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--faults","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/gaitcoat--faults"},{"std":"kc","part":"gaitcoat","partJa":"歩様・被毛・欠点","partEn":"Gait, coat & faults","idx":3,"labelJa":"注記","labelEn":"N.B.","ja":"牡は、見た目に正常な睾丸が2つ、陰嚢へ完全に下降していること","en":"Males should have two apparently normal testicles fully descended into the scrotum","orig":"","slug":"gaitcoat--n-b","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/gaitcoat--n-b"},{"std":"fci","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":0,"labelJa":"毛色","labelEn":"Colour","ja":"全ての色とマーキングは同等に扱われる。パーティカラーは均等に色分けされていること。アルビノ、レバー、マールは容認できない","en":"All colours and markings are of equal merit. Parti-colours must be evenly coloured (divided). Albino, liver and merle are unacceptable","orig":"","slug":"colour--colour","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/colour--colour"},{"std":"fci","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":1,"labelJa":"色素（顔の項目）","labelEn":"Pigment (facial section)","ja":"鼻・唇・目の縁の黒い色素が必須。白い毛色でもこの色素は変わらない――ホワイトとアルビノを見分ける根拠はここにある","en":"Black pigment is essential on the nose, lips and eye rims. This pigment does not change with a white coat — and that is exactly where the distinction between white and albino lies","orig":"","slug":"colour--pigment-facial-section","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/colour--pigment-facial-section"},{"std":"fci","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":2,"labelJa":"読み方","labelEn":"How to read","ja":"毛色の項目が求めるのは「好ましい色」ではなく、同等であること、パーティの均等さ、そして不可の3つに当たらないことだけである","en":"What the colour section asks for is not a “preferred colour”. It asks only that colours be equal, that parti-colour be even, and that the dog not fall under the three impermissible items","orig":"","slug":"colour--how-to-read","address":"pekingese-atlas://fci/colour--how-to-read"},{"std":"akc","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":0,"labelJa":"毛色","labelEn":"Colour","ja":"全ての毛色とマーキングが許され、同等の価値である。なお、除外条項（不可の色名）はAKC文にはありません（この一文は本アプリの解説です）。","en":"All coat colours and markings are allowable and of equal merit. Note that the AKC text contains no exclusion clause (no list of impermissible colours) (this sentence is this app’s commentary).","orig":"All coat colors and markings are allowable and of equal merit.","slug":"colour--colour","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/colour--colour"},{"std":"akc","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":1,"labelJa":"マスク","labelEn":"Mask","ja":"黒いマスクも、セルフカラーの顔も、同等に受け入れられる。マスクの有無で顔の評価は変わらない","en":"A black mask and a self-coloured face are equally acceptable. The presence or absence of a mask does not change the assessment of the face","orig":"","slug":"colour--mask","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/colour--mask"},{"std":"akc","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":2,"labelJa":"色素","labelEn":"Pigment","ja":"毛色に関わらず、マズル・鼻・唇・目の縁の露出した皮膚は黒い。色素の確認は毛色の判定とセットである","en":"Whatever the coat colour, the exposed skin of muzzle, nose, lips and eye rims is black. Checking pigment is part and parcel of judging colour","orig":"","slug":"colour--pigment","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/colour--pigment"},{"std":"akc","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":3,"labelJa":"読み方","labelEn":"How to read","ja":"AKC文にはアルビノ・レバー・マールの名指しの禁止がない。だからといって色素の欠けた個体を是とする文でもなく、色素は黒いことが前提として書かれている","en":"The AKC text does not prohibit albino, liver or merle by name. That does not make it a text that approves pigment-deficient dogs: black pigment is written in as a premise","orig":"","slug":"colour--how-to-read","address":"pekingese-atlas://akc/colour--how-to-read"},{"std":"kc","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":0,"labelJa":"毛色","labelEn":"Colour","ja":"全ての色とマーキングは同等の価値である。パーティカラーは均等に分かれていること。アルビノ、レバー、マールは容認できない","en":"All colours and markings are of equal merit. Parti-colours must be evenly divided. Albino, liver and merle are unacceptable","orig":"","slug":"colour--colour","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/colour--colour"},{"std":"kc","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":1,"labelJa":"色素（頭・顔の項目）","labelEn":"Pigment (head & face sections)","ja":"鼻・唇・目の縁の黒い色素が必須","en":"Black pigment is essential on the nose, lips and eye rims","orig":"","slug":"colour--pigment-head-face-sections","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/colour--pigment-head-face-sections"},{"std":"kc","part":"colour","partJa":"毛色","partEn":"Colour","idx":2,"labelJa":"読み方","labelEn":"How to read","ja":"英国の物差しでも、色は同等が原則で、例外は不可の3つのみ。ホワイト／パーティを色だけで退ける根拠はKC文にもない","en":"On the British measure, too, equality of colour is the principle and the only exceptions are the three impermissible items. The KC text gives no ground for rejecting white or parti-colour on colour alone","orig":"","slug":"colour--how-to-read","address":"pekingese-atlas://kc/colour--how-to-read"}]};
